      "created_at": "2024-04-15T11:55:56.429Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>Im already hiding timeline-items with this script:</p>\n<p>frappe.ui.form.on(“Doctype”, {<br>\nrefresh: function (frm) {<br>\n$(‘.timeline-items’).hide();<br>\n}<br>\n});</p>\n<p>Since i upgraded to v15, the Activity Topic is back but timeline-items still hidden:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/a/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09\" title=\"Activity\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/a/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09_2_690x234.png\" alt=\"Activity\" data-base62-sha1=\"64if89NeMy97m8fOjcsnbMfyl2p\" width=\"690\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/a/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09_2_690x234.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/a/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09_2_1035x351.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/a/2a894ff482ffd3a190280eb8fc3dbd751b514b09.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"171717\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Activity</span><span class=\"informations\">1254×426 2.63 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>How can I hide the Activity Topic ?</p>",
