      "created_at": "2024-04-15T12:23:56.703Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/k452\">@k452</a>,</p>\n<p>I already provided the solution for your same topic.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"104120\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/48/66573_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/hide-audit-trail/104120/2\">Hide Audit Trail</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/erpnext/6\"><span data-category-id=\"6\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #BF1E2E; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">ERPNext</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/k452\">@k452</a>, \nPlease apply custom/client scipt for it. \nfrappe.ui.form.on(\"DocType\", {\n  refresh: function (frm) {\n      $('.timeline-items').hide();\n  }\n});\n\nSet your doctype in script. \nThen reload (Ctrl + Shift + R) and check it. \nThank You!\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>If not work then apply it.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.ui.form.on(\"DocType\", {\n  refresh: function (frm) {\n      setTimeout(() =&gt; {\n        $('.timeline-items').hide();\n      }, 10);\n  }\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>Please set your doctype name in the script.</p>",
